Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|osgi.module.configuration.file.names|com.liferay.captcha.configuration.CaptchaConfiguration.config|
		|osgi.module.configurations|maxChallenges="0"|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Security|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: View Captcha Enabled
Priority: 4
	Given SignInNavigator goto Create Account
	When User view Captcha PG
		|captchaType|captcha|
Scenario: View Recaptcha Enabled
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|Captcha#ViewRecaptchaEnabled|
	When these variables
		|recaptchaPrivateKey||
	And these variables
		|recaptchaPublicKey||
	And User first Login PG
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|System Settings|
	And SystemSettings goto Category
		|category|Foundation|
	And SystemSettings edit Configuration
		|configurationName|CAPTCHA|
	And FormFields select Select Option
		|fieldName|captchaEngine|
		|selectOption|reCAPTCHA|
	And SystemSettings edit Text Area Setting
		|settingName|reCaptchaPrivateKey|
		|settingValue|${recaptchaPrivateKey}|
	And SystemSettings edit Text Area Setting
		|settingName|reCaptchaPublicKey|
		|settingValue|${recaptchaPublicKey}|
	And SystemSettings save Configuration
	And User logout PG
	And SignInNavigator goto Create Account
	Then User view Captcha PG
		|captchaType|recaptcha|